<title>POLAND: Universal sees group net doubling in 1996.</title>
<headline>Universal sees group net doubling in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader Universal expects to lift consolidated net profit to 47 million zlotys from 19.4 million zlotys last year, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Universal's parent company made a 12-million-zloty net profit last year and 12.3 million zlotys over the first three quarters this year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
